<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/rescuerstyle.css">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icons/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
    <title>Rescuer's Dashboard</title>
    <!-- Leaflet -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" integrity="sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY=" crossorigin="" />
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" integrity="sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=" crossorigin=""></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet-routing-machine@latest/dist/leaflet-routing-machine.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet-routing-machine@3.2.12/dist/leaflet-routing-machine.css" />
    <style>
        #map {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100vh; /* Fill the entire iframe */
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header-links">
    <a href="#" id="instructionsLink" class="left-link">Οδηγίες</a>
    <a href="/logout" class="right-link">Logout</a>
</div>

<!-- Instructions Modal -->
<div id="instructionsModal" class="modal">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <span class="close-modal">&times;</span>
        <h2>Οδηγίες</h2>
        <p>1. Σύρε το όχημα <img src="/icons/transport.png" style="width: 3%; height: 3%;"> στην Τοποθεσία σου.</p>
        <p>2. Επέλεξε το κουμπί 'Φόρτωση' ή 'Εκφόρτωση' όταν βρίσκεσαι σε απόσταση μέχρι 100m από τη Γενική Αποθήκη για την παραλαβή προμηθειών.</p>
        <p>3. Επέλεξε μέχρι 4 πολίτες <img src="/icons/peoplePending.png" style="width: 3%; height: 3%;"> για να εξυπηρετήσεις.</p>
        <p>4. Για να επιθεωρήσεις το τρέχον φορτίο του οχήματος επέλεξε το κουμπί 'Τρέχον Φορτίο'.</p>
        <p>5. Υπομνήματα Χάρτη: </p>
        <p>    *<img src="/icons/donate.png" style="width: 2%; height: 2%;">: Δωρεά Αγαθών</p>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Modal for Displaying Products -->
<div id="productModal" class="modal">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <span class="close-modal">&times;</span>
        <div class="modal-buttons">
            <button id="loadButton" class="inactive">Φόρτωση</button>
        </div>
        <h2>Available Products in General Storage</h2>
        <div class="product-list">
            <table id="productTable">
                <!-- Table will be populated by JavaScript -->
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<h1>Rescuer's Dashboard</h1>
<div class="dashboard-container">
    
    <div class="map-container">
        <div id="map"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="cargo-container">
        <!-- Tabs for switching between Cargo and Tasks -->
        <div class="tabs">
            <button id="cargoTabBtn" class="button-active" onclick="openTab('cargoTab', this)">Cargo</button>
            <button id="taskTabBtn" class="button-inactive" onclick="openTab('tasksTab', this)">Tasks</button>

        </div>
    
        <!-- Content for Cargo tab -->
        <div id="cargoTab" class="tab-content active">
            <button id="unloadButton" class="inactive">Εκφόρτωση</button>
            <div id="loadedProducts" ></div> <!-- Placeholder for loaded products style="display: none;" -->
        </div>
    
        <!-- Content for Tasks tab -->
        <div id="tasksTab" class="tab-content">

            <h3>Your tasks will appear here.</h3>
            <table id="tasksTable">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>#</th>
                        <th>No</th>
                        <th>Type</th>
                        <th>Name</th>
                        <th>Cell Phone</th>
                        <th>Date to be delivered</th>
                        <th>Action</th>
                        <th></th> <!-- Placeholder for the red X button -->
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <!-- *** Commented Out for Placeholder *** -->
                <tbody>
                    
                </tbody>
            </table>

            
        </div>
    </div>
    

    <button id="filterToggleButton" class="filter-button">Φίλτρα Χάρτη</button>

    <div id="filters" class="filter-container">
        <h3>Tasks</h3>
        
        <label>
            <input type="checkbox" class="main-filter" value="pending"> Pending
        </label>
        <label>
            <input type="checkbox" class="main-filter" value="served"> Served
        </label>

        <h4>Type</h4>
        
        <label>
            <input type="checkbox" class="sub-filter" value="request"> Request
        </label>
        <label>
            <input type="checkbox" class="sub-filter" value="donation"> Donation
        </label>
    </div>

</body>

<script src="/rescuerScripts/loadMap.js"></script>
</html>